<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v3"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2622391688"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1763799883"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="FALLOUT"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="NAQT VANE"/><amll:meta key="album" value="FALLOUT"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:26.684"><div begin="00:04.535" end="03:24.694"><p begin="00:04.535" end="00:05.525" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">Just so tragic<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的人生注定是一场悲剧吗?</span></p><p begin="00:05.525" end="00:06.577" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">Is it my life?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这就是我的人生？</span></p><p begin="00:06.662" end="00:08.721" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">ナンセンスな 存在証明<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">存在证明毫无意义可言</span></p><p begin="00:08.721" end="00:09.465" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">Encoded<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">编码就在字里行间之中</span></p><p begin="00:09.465" end="00:10.687" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">In the writing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">字里行间</span></p><p begin="00:10.687" end="00:12.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">ダサいアンチテーゼ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真是庸俗的反命题</span></p><p begin="00:12.380" end="00:14.487" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">感情論なんて 曖昧<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感情论模棱两可</span></p><p begin="00:14.629" end="00:15.656" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Behind the door's<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">门后会有什么依旧是个谜</span></p><p begin="00:15.656" end="00:16.602" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">A mystery<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算知道不可为依然要步入其中</span></p><p begin="00:16.644" end="00:18.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">ダメって分かっていても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算知道不可以</span></p><p begin="00:18.562" end="00:19.661" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Entering<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">进入</span></p><p begin="00:20.276" end="00:22.745" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Distorted mirrors in the smoke<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">镜子在烟雾之中尽显扭曲</span></p><p begin="00:22.745" end="00:23.414" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Auto-lock<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自动锁定是在开玩笑吗?</span></p><p begin="00:23.414" end="00:24.597" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Is this a joke?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开什么玩笑？</span></p><p begin="00:24.786" end="00:28.166" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L15">大胆不敵な somebody<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大胆无畏的某个人</span></p><p begin="00:28.211" end="00:29.795" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L16">溺れた生活の中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沉溺于生活中</span></p><p begin="00:29.795" end="00:31.978" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L17">None of them but myself 楽しむワザ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">除了我自己 谁都不可能享受其中</span></p><p begin="00:32.060" end="00:32.585" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L18">騙して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">欺骗之后逃脱</span></p><p begin="00:32.585" end="00:33.354" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L19">Escape<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许这是我要迎来的转变</span></p><p begin="00:33.824" end="00:35.681" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L20">Could be my transformation<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许这就是我的蜕变</span></p><p begin="00:35.881" end="00:38.144" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L21">It's coming up to face the fallout<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">勇敢面对即将到来的那个后果</span></p><p begin="00:38.156" end="00:40.162" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L22">逸脱していく gallantry<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">骑士精神逐渐产生偏离</span></p><p begin="00:40.254" end="00:42.179" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L23">目前の偽証 睨んで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">睥睨着眼前的伪证</span></p><p begin="00:42.179" end="00:43.711" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L24">My Transformation<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将由此发生转变</span></p><p begin="00:43.711" end="00:46.010" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L25">It's coming up to face the fallout<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">勇敢面对即将到来的那个后果</span></p><p begin="00:46.084" end="00:50.336" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L26">この身体過剰に満たして satisfaction<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">满足的感觉已过度充盈这具身体</span></p><p begin="00:50.664" end="00:53.237" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L27">I gotta break it and remove my body<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我必须要打破桎梏 脱离我的躯壳</span></p><p begin="00:53.242" end="00:55.461" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L28">研ぎ澄ました感覚通り<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">遵循愈发敏锐的感觉</span></p><p begin="00:55.754" end="00:57.552" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L29">Take me back and let it go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带我回到过去 顺其自然</span></p><p begin="00:57.679" end="00:59.192" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L30">理想的な姿<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以理想的姿态</span></p><p begin="00:59.192" end="01:01.117" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L31">Break it and remove my body<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">打破桎梏 脱离我的躯壳</span></p><p begin="01:01.190" end="01:03.352" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L32">飛び超えた scenario analysis<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就此超越当下的场景分析</span></p><p begin="01:03.626" end="01:05.370" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L33">Take me back and let it go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带我回到过去 顺其自然</span></p><p begin="01:05.590" end="01:07.148" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L34">Cuz it doesn’ t matter<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为这一切并不重要</span></p><p begin="01:10.443" end="01:13.165" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L35">By the way I 気付かないうちに桃源郷の向こう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">顺便说一句</span></p><p begin="01:13.165" end="01:14.629" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L36">足浸す川に躊躇 refrain<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">踏入河流中犹豫不前</span></p><p begin="01:14.629" end="01:16.086" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L37">駆け廻る恐怖と regret<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恐惧与悔恨就此逡巡于心</span></p><p begin="01:16.086" end="01:16.569" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L38">そう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从上到下 不论是头部 肩膀 膝盖还是脚趾</span></p><p begin="01:16.569" end="01:18.989" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L39">From bottom to the top, head, shoulders, knees and toes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从下到上 头 肩膀 膝盖 脚趾</span></p><p begin="01:19.249" end="01:21.540" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L40">ギアの噛み合う音が吐き出す咎<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">齿轮咬合的声音将罪责倾吐而出</span></p><p begin="01:21.710" end="01:24.129" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L41">Figure it out an easy way to come back to life<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要找出一条简单的路助我回归正常的人生</span></p><p begin="01:24.129" end="01:24.699" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L42">Now you see?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在你看到了吗?</span></p><p begin="01:24.699" end="01:26.928" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L43">窮鼠猫を噛むほど sick and bold<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如穷鼠啮猫般病态而大胆</span></p><p begin="01:27.077" end="01:29.651" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">Distorted mirrors in the smoke<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">镜子在烟雾之中尽显扭曲</span></p><p begin="01:29.651" end="01:30.388" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">Auto-lock<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自动锁定是在开玩笑吗?</span></p><p begin="01:30.388" end="01:31.590" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">Is this a joke?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在得不到认可的社会</span></p><p begin="01:31.598" end="01:35.081" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L47">認識されない society<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不被认知的社会</span></p><p begin="01:35.104" end="01:36.745" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L48">ガムシャラに善人のまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍不顾一切地行善助人</span></p><p begin="01:36.745" end="01:38.817" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L49">An apple of discord 取り除くまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直至将祸端彻底地清除之前</span></p><p begin="01:39.002" end="01:40.120" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L50">演じてる冷静<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">演绎冷静的模样</span></p><p begin="01:40.703" end="01:42.683" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L51">Could be my transformation<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许这是我要迎来的转变</span></p><p begin="01:42.704" end="01:45.084" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L52">It's coming up to face the fallout<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">勇敢面对即将到来的那个后果</span></p><p begin="01:45.093" end="01:47.029" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L53">始まりの予感は freak out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开始的预感让人惊惶无措</span></p><p begin="01:47.137" end="01:49.049" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L54">あの日に心砕いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾在往昔心碎过</span></p><p begin="01:49.049" end="01:50.588" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L55">My Transformation<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将由此发生转变</span></p><p begin="01:50.588" end="01:52.862" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L56">It's coming up to face the fallout<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">勇敢面对即将到来的那个后果</span></p><p begin="01:52.862" end="01:57.151" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L57">胸の底にチューニング合わせて get the NEW me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在心中将一切全都调和一番</span></p><p begin="01:57.500" end="02:00.121" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L58">I gotta break it and remove my body<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我必须要打破桎梏 脱离我的躯壳</span></p><p begin="02:00.121" end="02:02.244" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L59">予測していたそれ以上に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有的一切已超出预期</span></p><p begin="02:02.560" end="02:04.358" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L60">Take me back and let it go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带我回到过去 顺其自然</span></p><p begin="02:04.450" end="02:06.055" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L61">掻い潜っていく修羅場<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">挣扎着潜入修罗场中</span></p><p begin="02:06.055" end="02:08.042" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L62">Break it and remove my body<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">打破桎梏 脱离我的躯壳</span></p><p begin="02:08.042" end="02:10.223" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L63">測れない気持ちの体積<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心情膨胀到无法测量</span></p><p begin="02:10.409" end="02:12.240" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L64">Take me back and let it go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带我回到过去 顺其自然</span></p><p begin="02:12.387" end="02:14.038" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L65">Cuz it doesn’ t matter<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为这一切并不重要</span></p><p begin="02:22.037" end="02:25.764" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L66">繊細な筋書きを噛み締めるたびに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每当我细细品味细腻的情节设定时</span></p><p begin="02:25.976" end="02:30.054" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L67">Hallucinating there's a fancy trick that we need<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都在幻想构思我们所需要的那个华丽把戏</span></p><p begin="02:30.074" end="02:31.850" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L68">祈りも重ねる願いも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">祈祷与交织的心愿都已经沦为徒劳</span></p><p begin="02:31.850" end="02:33.841" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L69">Won't help at all 最後には<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最后将会赌上自己的一切</span></p><p begin="02:34.058" end="02:35.708" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L70">己が全て賭けて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把一切押在自己身上</span></p><p begin="02:35.736" end="02:37.623" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L71">Could be my transformation<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许这是我要迎来的转变</span></p><p begin="02:37.798" end="02:40.002" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L72">It's coming up to face the fallout<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">勇敢面对即将到来的那个后果</span></p><p begin="02:40.201" end="02:42.053" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L73">逸脱していく gallantry<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">骑士精神逐渐产生偏离</span></p><p begin="02:42.161" end="02:45.588" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L74">目前の偽証 睨んで My Transformation<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">睥睨着眼前的伪证</span></p><p begin="02:45.588" end="02:47.899" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L75">It's coming up to face the fallout<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">勇敢面对即将到来的那个后果</span></p><p begin="02:47.930" end="02:52.266" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L76">この身体過剰に満たして satisfaction<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">满足的感觉已过度充盈这具身体</span></p><p begin="02:52.719" end="02:55.165" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L77">I gotta break it and remove my body<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我必须要打破桎梏 脱离我的躯壳</span></p><p begin="02:55.255" end="02:57.419" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L78">研ぎ澄ました感覚通り<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">遵循愈发敏锐的感觉</span></p><p begin="02:57.621" end="02:59.472" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L79">Take me back and let it go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带我回到过去 顺其自然</span></p><p begin="02:59.619" end="03:01.100" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L80">理想的な姿<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以理想的姿态</span></p><p begin="03:01.100" end="03:03.122" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L81">Break it and remove my body<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">打破桎梏 脱离我的躯壳</span></p><p begin="03:03.122" end="03:05.283" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L82">飛び超えた scenario analysis<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就此超越当下的场景分析</span></p><p begin="03:05.522" end="03:07.320" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L83">Take me back and let it go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带我回到过去 顺其自然</span></p><p begin="03:07.429" end="03:09.072" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L84">Cuz it doesn't matter<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为这一切并不重要</span></p><p begin="03:09.259" end="03:09.700" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L85">For sure<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毋庸置疑 关联这个名字 奔赴下个舞台</span></p><p begin="03:09.700" end="03:11.130" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L86">この名繋ぐ 次へのステップ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将这个名字接续到下一步</span></p><p begin="03:11.219" end="03:12.120" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L87">Let me start it up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我就此开始吧</span></p><p begin="03:12.128" end="03:12.881" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L88">Let's start it up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们开始吧</span></p><p begin="03:12.881" end="03:14.382" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L89">誤魔化せない 誤魔化したくない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难以粉饰遮掩也不再有这样的想法</span></p><p begin="03:14.382" end="03:16.628" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L90">持論 世論 波紋 keep on 自問自答<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">个人观点 公众舆论终将产生影响 为此自问自答</span></p><p begin="03:16.628" end="03:18.352" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L91">速攻繰り出せば so cold<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一系列的迅速出击 尽显冷酷</span></p><p begin="03:18.352" end="03:20.253" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L92">痛み分けは陳腐かつ軽はずみなファンタジー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">分担痛楚</span></p><p begin="03:20.253" end="03:22.533" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L93">瞬きの間にページ飛ばしたこの身は不可逆<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">顷刻之间就已翻过这一页</span></p><p begin="03:22.533" end="03:24.694" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L94">Show me which way to death or glory<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这具身体不可逆转</span></p></div></body></tt>